# Keep the build context small + force a clean install inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-verify
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/coverage
# Stale TypeScript incremental caches would make a composite `tsc` (packages/types)
# think it's already built and skip emit inside the image. Git already ignores
# these; exclude them from the build context too so local + Railway builds match.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
